      "questions": "<div class=\"section-block\" id=\"listening-part-1\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"num\">Questions 1–10</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Complete the table below. Write <em>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</em> for each answer.</div>\n      <h2>Student Accommodation</h2>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"ielts-table acc-table\">\n      <tr><th>Type</th><th>Cost</th><th>Contract</th></tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Example<br>College:<br><b>Single room</b></td>\n        <td>Standard: £3276 per year<br>\n            En-suite: £ <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-1\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">1</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_1_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 1\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_1\"></span></span> per year<br>\n            (meals are not included)</td>\n        <td>36 weeks<br>\n            (Rooms not available during the <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-2\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">2</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_2_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 2\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_2\"></span></span>)</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td><span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-3\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">3</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_3_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 3\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_3\"></span></span> :<br>Room with a family</td>\n        <td>£150 per week – all inclusive</td>\n        <td>Arrangements are <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-4\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">4</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_4_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 4\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_4\"></span></span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Private renting:<br>room in a share house<br>or<br>a <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-5\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">5</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_5_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 5\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_5\"></span></span></td>\n        <td>From £275 to £490 per month<br>\n            Additional costs (for this year)<br>\n            • gas and electricity £ <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-6\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">6</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_6_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 6\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_6\"></span></span> per month approx<br>\n            • <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-7\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">7</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_7_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 7\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_7\"></span></span> : £9<br>\n            • <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-8\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">8</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_8_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 8\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_8\"></span></span></td>\n        <td>6 months<br>\n            Need<br>\n            • <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-9\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">9</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_9_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 9\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_9\"></span></span><br>\n            • two <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-10\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">10</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_12_10_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 10\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_12_10\"></span></span></td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>",
