      "questions": "<div class=\"section-block\" id=\"listening-part-3\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"num\">Questions 21–24</div>\n      <h2>Pacific tapa cloth</h2>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Choose the correct letter, <em>A, B or C</em>.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-card-21\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">21</strong>\n    <div class=\"q-row\">\n      <span class=\"q-pill\">21</span>\n      <div class=\"q-text\">Pacific tapa cloth is different from other types of tapa cloth because it is</div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\"><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_21\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_12_21_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: A\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span>the only tapa made today</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_21\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_12_21_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: B\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span>better quality than others</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_21\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_12_21_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: C\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span>put to a wider range of uses</label></div>\n  </div><div class=\"q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-card-22\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">22</strong>\n    <div class=\"q-row\">\n      <span class=\"q-pill\">22</span>\n      <div class=\"q-text\">What does Helen say about the paper mulberry tree?</div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\"><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_22\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_12_22_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: A\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span>It is also a source of food</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_22\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_12_22_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: B\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span>It is not native to the Pacific</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_22\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_12_22_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: C\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span>It can grow in any environment</label></div>\n  </div><div class=\"q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-card-23\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">23</strong>\n    <div class=\"q-row\">\n      <span class=\"q-pill\">23</span>\n      <div class=\"q-text\">Why did the Maori people of New Zealand stop making tapa?</div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\"><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_23\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_12_23_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: A\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span>They could not find the right trees in New Zealand</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_23\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_12_23_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: B\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span>They were introduced to other fabrics by the Europeans</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_23\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_12_23_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: C\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span>They found a better material for making fabric</label></div>\n  </div><div class=\"q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-card-24\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">24</strong>\n    <div class=\"q-row\">\n      <span class=\"q-pill\">24</span>\n      <div class=\"q-text\">Large pieces of tapa are made from smaller pieces which are</div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\"><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_24\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_12_24_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: A\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span>stuck together</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_24\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_12_24_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: B\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span>woven together</label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_12_24\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_12_24_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: C\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span>sewn together</label></div>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"num\">Questions 25–30</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">According to the speakers, what function has tapa cloth played in the following countries? Move the correct letter, <em>A, B, C or D</em>, into the gaps next to questions 25–30. <em>Any letter may be used more than once.</em></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"drag-match-layout\">\n      <div class=\"drag-left\">\n        <div class=\"drag-col-hdr\">Countries</div>\n        <div class=\"drag-items\"><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-25\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">25</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Samoa</span><select name=\"practice_12_25\" id=\"practice_12_25_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 25\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-26\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">26</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Tonga</span><select name=\"practice_12_26\" id=\"practice_12_26_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 26\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-27\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">27</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Cook Islands</span><select name=\"practice_12_27\" id=\"practice_12_27_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 27\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-28\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">28</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Fiji</span><select name=\"practice_12_28\" id=\"practice_12_28_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-29\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">29</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Tahiti</span><select name=\"practice_12_29\" id=\"practice_12_29_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 29\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div><div class=\"drag-item-row ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lq-row-30\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">30</strong><span class=\"drag-item-label\">Tikopia</span><select name=\"practice_12_30\" id=\"practice_12_30_\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 30\"><option value=\"\">Choose an answer</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"B\">B</option><option value=\"C\">C</option><option value=\"D\">D</option></select></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drag-right\">\n        <div class=\"drag-col-hdr\">Functions A–D</div>\n        <div class=\"drag-pool\" id=\"pool-fn\"><div class=\"drag-chip\" id=\"dchip